1
00:00:00,538 --> 00:00:02,108
(Sheldon:)but I would not leave
cash lying around.

2
00:00:02,106 --> 00:00:04,176
(Scene:)Sheldon,

3
00:00:04,175 --> 00:00:05,575
(Sheldon:)what do you think
you're doing?

4
00:00:05,576 --> 00:00:07,906
(Sheldon:)My room is paid up
until the end of the month,

5
00:00:07,912 --> 00:00:09,312
(Sheldon:)so I can do
with it whatever

6
00:00:09,313 --> 00:00:10,583
(Sheldon:)I please, which includes

7
00:00:10,581 --> 00:00:13,151
(Sheldon:)renting it out
for a dollar a night.

8
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:14,980
(Theodore:)It's like the '40s again.

9
00:00:18,155 --> 00:00:20,855
(Sheldon:)Anyway, I'll leave you be.

10
00:00:20,858 --> 00:00:22,058
I have to... oh, oh!

11
00:00:22,059 --> 00:00:24,159
(Sheldon:)He's expecting a newspaper
in the morning.

12
00:00:24,161 --> 00:00:26,361
(Sheldon:)Apparently,
they still make them.

13
00:00:26,363 --> 00:00:29,093
(Penny:)All right, Sheldon,
this is over the line.

14
00:00:29,099 --> 00:00:30,069
(Sheldon:)That's true,

15
00:00:30,067 --> 00:00:32,167
(Sheldon:)but had I done
something under the line,

16
00:00:32,169 --> 00:00:33,669
(Sheldon:)there wouldn't be a man
in your kitchen

17
00:00:33,671 --> 00:00:35,941
(Sheldon:)who can't produce
a single form of ID.

18
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,810
(Theodore:)Oh, oh, I have a receipt
from a blood bank.

19
00:00:38,409 --> 00:00:40,879
(Theodore:)I'm O-negative.

20
00:00:44,081 --> 00:00:46,811
(Sheldon:)And now you know as much
about him as I do.

21
00:00:50,187 --> 00:00:52,217
(Raj:)Oh, hey, Bernadette,

22
00:00:52,223 --> 00:00:54,253
(Raj:)the swing comes
with two different mobiles.

23
00:00:54,258 --> 00:00:58,128
(Raj:)The giraffes are pretty cute,
what do you think?

24
00:00:58,128 --> 00:00:59,858
(Bernadette:)Great, go with the giraffes.

25
00:00:59,864 --> 00:01:01,094
(Sheldon:)Although...

